# Keep the worker image lean + the build reproducible (deps come from a frozen
# pnpm install, not the host node_modules). Context is the repo root.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo
**/.vite
**/coverage
.git
.github
.vercel
.gstack
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.DS_Store
*.log
# Secrets must never reach the image (QA D8): env files at ANY depth, the
# worker.env the run docs use, keys and local dumps. (.npmrc stays: it is
# tracked pnpm config with no credentials — excluding it changes the install;
# never commit an auth token to it.)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/dump.rdb
# Apps the worker image doesn't run: keep only their manifests so the pnpm
# workspace still matches pnpm-lock.yaml (frozen install).
apps/web/**
!apps/web/package.json
apps/mobile/**
!apps/mobile/package.json
